NOTES: Working name only; no claim of official Mobily branding. Branding screen details belong to §15 (AN-03). DG5 analyst check (T-DG5-AN-P5A, base f78afff): branding.test.ts asserts a fresh database serves 'Mobily Transformation Hub' (en, ar) and that the next generated report carries the new name in its header in en and ar; feg.test.tsx and p5-reader-branding-demo.spec.ts (chromium-en and chromium-ar) show the configured name in the shell header without a code change; QA-A's A06 suite asserts only the API part, and these implementer tests cover the shell-header and report-header clauses it left open; the name is a working name, with no claim of official Mobily branding.

