NOTES: AN-05 (§21 recheck): moved from P4;P5;P6/DG6 to P4;P5/DG5. The DG5 evidence 'durable rule retries' (M0408), and REQ-S12-002 (DG5, retry without duplicating actions), need de-duplicated side effects. P6 re-runs A13 at DG6. DG5 analyst check (T-DG5-AN-P5B, base f78afff): A13D 'replaying the same event three times' re-relays and re-delivers an admin rule's event 3x (1 execution, 1 task, 1 reminder) and a native G1 submission's gate.submitted 3x (the Sponsor's approval task and all work items and notifications unchanged), with a13-jobs-rerun covering the export and Day-90 job replays.

